<h3><u>Sab ka hussain</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><big>allah allah<br><br>jaayen bashar ki nigaahein jahaan<br>maujud hai teri rehmat wahaan<br>hai teri rehmaaniyat se ayaan<br>mehdud hai teri rehmat kahaan<br><br>tere hi jaisa mohammad tera<br>jis ke liye shaayeron ne kaha<br><br>ishq hojaaye kisi se koyi chaara to nahin<br>sirf muslim ka mohammad pe ijaara to nahin<br><br>hai us mohammad ki aankhon ka chain<br>kehta hai jis ko zamaana hussain<br><br>insaaniyat pe huwa wo fida<br>har ek muslim to kehta hi tha<br>ab ghair muslim bhi kehne laga<br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>aalam ka maqsood naame hussain&nbsp; <br>har dil me maujud naame hussain&nbsp; <br>phir kyun ho mehdood naame hussain&nbsp; <br>hai hamd o mehmood naame hussain<br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>bachpan ka waada wafa yun kiya&nbsp; <br>kaaba bachaaya bhara ghar diya&nbsp; <br>jo kaam kar na sake ambiya&nbsp; <br>phir kyun na tu hi bata ay khuda&nbsp; <br><br>saari duniya hussain hussain kare<br><br>aaqa hussain maula hussain<br>rab ka hussain sab ka hussain<br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ehle sunnat wal jamaat ke buzurg shayer</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">peer naseer-ud-din shah farmaate hain</span><br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">mera khuda jise auje kamaal deta hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">use batool ki chaukhat pe daal deta hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">parakhna ho jo kisi ko to ya hussain kaho</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ye naam wo hai jo shajre khangaal deta hai</span><br><br>sunni ye kehte hain ya mustafa<br>tu ne hi ham ko aqeeda diya<br>tu ne hussain o minni jo kaha<br>phir to ye kehna bhi sunnat huwa<br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ek hindu shayer jay singh ne imam hussain</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ki baargaah me yun nazraanaye aqeedat pesh kiya</span><br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">hai aaj bhi zamaane me charcha hussain ka</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">chalta hai kaainaat me sikka hussain ka</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">bhaarat me gar wo aate bhagwaan kehte ham</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">har hindu naam pooja me japta hussain ka</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">sar apna peet ti hain jo pyaason ki yaad me</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">leti hain naam ganga o jamna hussain ka</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">is me nahin kalaam ke ham but parast hain</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">aankhon se apni chumenge roza hussain ka</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ham paapiyon ke waaste hur ki misaal hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">chamkaata hai naseeb ishaara hussain ka</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">""jay singh"" panaah maangegi mujh se narag ki aag</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">mein hindu hun magar hun mein sheda hussain ka</span><br><br>hindu aqeede ka ailaan hai&nbsp; <br>shabbir pe jaan qurbaan hai&nbsp; <br>pooja ke qaabil hai bhagwaan hai&nbsp; <br>kehta ye saara hindustan hai&nbsp; <br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>sikh mazhab ke naamwar shaayer<br>kanwar mahendar singh bedi kehte hain<br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ya hussain ya hussain</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">lab peh jab shaahe shaheedaan tera naam aata hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">saamne saaqiye kausar liye jaam aata hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">mujh ko bhi apni ghulaami ka sharaf de dijiyo</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">khota sikka bhi to aaqa kabhi kaam aata hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ya hussain ya hussain</span><br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">tu to har deen ke har dor ke insaan ka hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">kam kabhi bhi teri tauqeer na hone denge</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ham salaamat hain zamaane me to inshaa allah</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">tujh ko ek qaum ki jaageer na hone denge</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ya hussain ya hussain</span><br><br>dekho sikhon ke bhi afkaar me&nbsp; <br>kya hai ""mahendar"" ke ashaar me<br>bola aqeedat ke izhaar me<br>mein bhi hussaini hun sansaar me<br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">ek isaai shaayer ne mola hussain se</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">aqeedat ka izhaar khuch is andaaz se kiya</span><br><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">faqat hai pyaar ka daawa har ek mazhab ka</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">jahaan bhi zulm hai nafrat hai wo jehaalat hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">yehi wo dars hai jo de gaye yasoo maseeh</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">jahaan me khidmate insaaniyat ibaadat hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">hussain aap ne insaaniyat ka dars diya</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">hussain aap ne soda zameer ka na kiya</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">hussain aap ka paighaam bhi mohabbat hai</span><br><span style=""font-style: italic;"">hussain aap ki duniya ko phir zaroorat hai</span><br><br>raahib jo tha ek isaai tha&nbsp; <br>aulaad na thi pareshaan tha&nbsp; <br>sheh ne kiye saat bete ataa&nbsp; <br>khush hoke dunya se kehne laga&nbsp; <br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>kyun saari duniya ki hai ye sada&nbsp; <br>batla rahi hai hame karbala&nbsp; <br>khanjar tale sheh ne sajda kiya&nbsp; <br>har zarra khaaliq se kehne laga&nbsp; <br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>insaan ka mohsin shahe karbala&nbsp; <br>insaan hi sheh ka qaatil bana&nbsp; <br>sab kalma go the sare nainawa&nbsp; <br>ehsaas kyun na kisi ko huwa&nbsp; <br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>kunbe ko us ke rulaayaa gaya&nbsp; <br>saydaaniyon ko kiya be rida&nbsp; <br>baazaar o darbaare ehle jafa&nbsp; <br>zainab ne har gaam khutba diya&nbsp; <br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>kyun na kahen ye jo islaam hai&nbsp; <br>shabbir ka dusra naam hai&nbsp; <br>ab to jo waajib hai ye kaam hai&nbsp; <br>""farhan"" o ""mazhar"" ka paighaam hai&nbsp; <br><br>tera hussain mera hussain <br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain<br>pyaare nabi ka nawaasa hussain<br><br>rab ka hussain<br>sab ka hussain</big></p>
